  "case": "constant_close",
  "derivation": "Every close is 100.00, so every 5-bar mean is 100.00. The first four bars have fewer than 5 closes and emit nothing; from bar index 4 onward the value is 100.00. This pins the warm-up boundary at exactly `period` bars - unlike Wilder's ATR, an SMA needs no seeding lag and emits on the period-th bar, not the period+1-th.",
